<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54145" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακηρύσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακήλ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>proclaim</i> or <i>command by
				public crier</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιωπήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(7).237.36
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιγήν</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.2.20
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be promulgated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				22.4.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			 also, <i>to be summoned by crier</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.61
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> at auction,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τι εἴς τινα</span>
			<i>order</i> it <i>to be knocked down</i> to one, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Comp.Lys.Sull.</u>
				3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
